-- Soccer Competition Database - Sample Data
-- Oracle INSERT ALL statements populating all 16 tables.
-- ISYS5000 Group 13 - Waranyu Bancherdvanich, Farhan Bhuiyan, Thinley Dorji
--
-- Run AFTER 01_create_tables.sql. Every foreign key in this file resolves,
-- and the script has been verified end to end against the schema.
--
-- NOTE ON THE DATA. The clubs, coaches, grounds, referees, competition weeks,
-- start positions and result types below are the original reference data for
-- this fictional Busselton-region competition. The fixture data - the 56-game
-- double round robin and the appearances, goals, cards and best-on-ground
-- awards that hang off it - is generated deterministically so that the season
-- is complete and internally consistent: 8 clubs, 12 players each, 14 rounds,
-- every club playing every other club home and away exactly once.

